%N A398625 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} 2^(2*k)/(k^3 * binomial(2*k,k)).
%H A398625 Jonathan M. Borwein and Marc Chamberland, <a href="http://doi.org/doi:10.1155/2007/19381">Integer Powers of Arcsin</a>, International Journal of Mathematics and Mathematical Sciences, Vol. 2007 (2007), Article 19381. See p. 10, eq. (5.11).
%H A398625 Amrik Singh Nimbran, Paul Levrie, and Anthony Sofo, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/s13398-021-01156-7">Harmonic-binomial Euler-like sums via expansions of (arcsin x)^p</a>, Revista de la Real Academia de Ciencias Exactas, Físicas y Naturales, Serie A. Matemáticas, Vol. 116 (2022), Article 23. See p. 5, eq. (2.3), and p. 17.
