%H A398625 I. J. Zucker, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-314X(85)90019-8">On the series Sum_{k=1..oo} binomial(2k,k)^(-1) k^(-n) and related sums</a>, Journal of Number Theory, Vol. 20, No. 1 (1985), pp. 92-102. See p. 96, eq. (2.12).
%F A398625 Equals 6*log(2)*zeta(2) - 7*zeta(3)/2 = Pi^2*log(2) - 7*zeta(3)/2.
%F A398625 Equals (1/2)*A377645 = 4*A225113 = 8*A173624.
%F A398625 Equals Sum_{k>=1} 4^k * H(k,2) / (k*(2*k+1)*binomial(2*k,k)), where H(k,2) = A007406(k)/A007407(k) is the k-th harmonic number of order 2.
